      "context": "Client Pick Row (F-10, local). One pick on Tinjau and Lihat pilihan. Main: thumbnail, file name, folder, Trailing slot (Icon Button remove for COUNT groups, Stepper for QUANTITY groups, disabled when read-only). Note (A-32): the client's note with 'Ubah catatan' (opens the note sheet); read-only views disable Note edit; a pick without a note on Tinjau replaces Note with the 'Tambah catatan' link; disable Note when the item has no pick notes. Last row: strokeWidth 0.",
